{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan an Nasai","section":{"51":"The Book of Drinks"},"section_detail":{"51":{"hadithnumber_first":5540,"hadithnumber_last":5758,"arabicnumber_first":5540,"arabicnumber_last":5758,"name_native":"كتاب الأشربة"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":5732,"arabicnumber":5732,"text":"اخبرنا سويد، قال انبانا عبد الله، عن هشام بن عايذ الاسدي، قال سالت ابراهيم عن العصير، قال اشربه حتى يغلي ما لم يتغير","grades":[{"name":"Abu Ghuddah","grade":"Sahih Isnaad Maqtu"},{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih Isnaad Maqtu"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Isnaad Hasan"}],"reference":{"book":51,"hadith":194}}]}